{"id":"democracia","lemma":"democracia","pos":"noun","rank":3076,"glosses":["democracy (rule by the people)","democracy (government under the rule of its people)"],"ipa":"/demoˈkɾaθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"democracias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/58/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-democracia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nuestra democracia está en decadencia.","en":"Our democracy is decaying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731554","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in decline, declining"]]},{"text":"La democracia es una forma de gobierno.","en":"Democracy is one form of government.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"shape"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"government"}]},{"text":"Hay definiciones distintas de democracia.","en":"There are different definitions of democracy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722170","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"definition","l":"definición"},{"g":"distinctly","l":"distinto"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"En una democracia es importante que la prensa sea independiente.","en":"In a democracy, it is important that the press be independent.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"press"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"independent"}]},{"text":"En una democracia, todos los ciudadanos tienen los mismos derechos.","en":"In a democracy, all citizens have equal rights.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"living in a city","l":"ciudadano"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"same","l":"mismo"},{"g":"right","l":"derecho"}]}]}